Error [jet.CallMarkRequired]: `archive` takes `title`, so the call writes `&&title`
  --> tests/ui/writes_policy_call_marks.jet:21:16
    |
 21 |     n: archive(title)
    |                ^^^^^
 Why: `archive: fn(title: &&String)` takes this input, and `#Policy(writes: .Explicit)` writes every change and take at the call
 Fix: Write `&&title`
