Error [jet.CallMarkRequired]: `count` neither changes nor takes `xs`, so it takes no `&`
  --> tests/ui/writes_policy_call_marks.jet:22:19
    |
 22 |     print("{count(&xs)} {n}")
    |                   ^
 Why: `count: fn(items: [Int])` reads this input; a mark says the call changes or takes the value, so it would tell the reader something false
 Fix: Remove the `&`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0228
